prompt_messages.content:
[[ ## user_request ## ]]
Create a bar chart with Aircraft on the x-axis and Passenger capacity on the y-axis. Color the bars by Max flight time.

[[ ## data_schema ## ]]
JSON Schema (8 rows):
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "Aircraft": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "Age": {
      "type": "integer"
    },
    "Passenger capacity": {
      "type": "integer"
    },
    "Mileage": {
      "type": "integer"
    },
    "Longest Flight time": {
      "type": "number"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "Age",
    "Aircraft",
    "Longest Flight time",
    "Mileage",
    "Passenger capacity"
  ]
}

Sample values:
  'Aircraft': ['AeroLynx A220', 'SkyBridge B737-900', 'Nimbus A321X', 'TitanAir B787-8', 'StratoCruise A350-900']
  'Age': [3, 9, 5, 7, 4]
  'Passenger capacity': [135, 178, 210, 242, 300]
  'Mileage': [420000, 2850000, 1600000, 3900000, 2100000]
  'Longest Flight time': [6.2, 7.1, 8.4, 15.6, 17.3]

IMPORTANT: This data has already been flattened. All fields are top-level with dot-separated names (e.g. 'employee.projects.startDate'). Do NOT use 'flatten' or 'fold' transforms. Reference field names directly.

Respond with the corresponding output fields, starting with the field `[[ ## reasoning ## ]]`, then `[[ ## vega_spec ## ]]`, and then ending with the marker for `[[ ## completed ## ]]`.

raw_response:
[[ ## reasoning ## ]] To create the bar chart as requested, we need to map the 'Aircraft' field to the x-axis, 'Passenger capacity' to the y-axis, and color the bars based on 'Longest Flight time'. This involves using the 'encode' functionality in Vega-Lite to specify the x, y, and color channels. Since 'Longest Flight time' is a continuous field and we are coloring by it, we will use a color scale that can handle continuous data, such as a sequential color scheme.

[[ ## vega_spec ## ]] 
{
  "mark": "bar",
  "encoding": {
    "x": {
      "field": "Aircraft",
      "type": "nominal"
    },
    "y": {
      "field": "Passenger capacity",
      "type": "quantitative"
    },
    "color": {
      "field": "Longest Flight time",
      "type": "quantitative",
      "scale": {
        "scheme": "blueorange"
      }
    }
  }
}

[[ ## completed ## ]]
